  "solution": "A molecule sweeps out a collision cylinder of cross-section $\\pi d^2$. Allowing for the motion of the other molecules (the factor $\\sqrt{2}$):\n$$\\lambda = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}\\,n\\pi d^2}$$",
